# vmxplore launcher — the VM estate console. Ships beside the vmx binary;
# consumed by the desktop app grid. Terminal=true because vmx is a TUI (the
# Fyne GUI arrives with the chassis extraction — design doc, Phase B); the
# desktop's default terminal hosts it, so no StartupWMClass is needed yet.
# When the GUI lands, revisit: GLFW derives WM_CLASS from the window title
# (the wgxplore lesson), so the title, this file's name and StartupWMClass
# must all agree.
[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=vmxplore
GenericName=VM Console
Comment=The ZFS-aware VM estate console — every domain joined to the zvol under it, lineage and all
Exec=vmx
Icon=vmxplore
Terminal=true
Categories=System;Monitor;
Keywords=vm;kvm;libvirt;virsh;zfs;zvol;clone;snapshot;estate;console;
